name: Chunked analysis refuses unused standard controls and keeps local planning auxiliary
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/strategy_consumers.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed @TMP_HOME
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: setg ui.auto_open_activity false
submit: setg ui.auto_open_viz false
submit: logs
submit: run agentic-sast:scan {"strategy":"chunked","includePatterns":["owned.c"]}
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/strategy_consumers.py @TMP_TARGET @ART include
require-live-snap: 25 option includePatterns requires strategy=standard | include-refused
submit: run agentic-sast:scan {"strategy":"chunked","max_model_turns":20}
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/strategy_consumers.py @TMP_TARGET @ART turns
require-live-snap: 25 option maxModelTurns requires strategy=standard | turn-limit-refused
submit: use agentic-sast
submit: options agentic-sast:scan
submit: setg max_inventory_files 80
submit: logs
submit: run agentic-sast:scan {"strategy":"chunked"}
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/strategy_consumers.py @TMP_TARGET @ART stored
paste-file: @ART/refusal-replay.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 REPLAY · Summary | stored-refusal
expect: option maxInventoryFiles requires strategy=standard
expect: No model request started.
resize: 160x48
live-snap: refusal-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: refusal-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: refusal-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: refusal-60x20
resize: 40x12
live-snap: refusal-40x12
expect: Tab receipt
keys: NPage
wait: 0.2
live-snap: refusal-reading-40x12
ask: Across six sizes, does the refusal identify the supplied limit, explain strategy ownership and make clear that no model request started?
resize: 120x36
keys: Escape
submit: options agentic-sast:scan
submit: unsetg maxInventoryFiles
submit: logs
submit: run agentic-sast:scan {"strategy":"chunked","excludePatterns":["other.c"]}
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/strategy_consumers.py @TMP_TARGET @ART exclude
require-live-snap: 25 option excludePatterns requires strategy=standard | exclusion-refused
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/strategy_consumers.py @TMP_TARGET @ART cleared
submit: run full-mode:hunt {"dryRun":true,"scopeFile":"scope.txt","reuseCachedChunks":false}
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/strategy_consumers.py @TMP_TARGET @ART planned
paste-file: @ART/plan-replay.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Outcome · completed | local-plan
expect: Planning only
expect: Cache reuse: disabled
ask: Is the local scope plan clearly separate from the refused scan requests, with exactly the selected source and no permission for model work?
keys: Escape
submit: report
require-live-snap: 25 Displayed Scan: blocked | auxiliary-plan-report
expect: 0 findings
expect-not: Displayed Scan: completed
keys: Home
keys: j j j
require-live-snap: 20 format json (4/6) | export-format
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 EXPORTED | exported
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/strategy_consumers.py @TMP_TARGET @ART exported
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
submit: logs
paste-file: @ART/refusal-replay.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 option maxInventoryFiles requires strategy=standard | recovered-refusal
submit: report
require-live-snap: 25 Displayed Scan: blocked | recovered-report
expect: 0 findings
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/strategy_consumers.py @TMP_TARGET @ART restarted
ask: Does no-color restart preserve the cleared setting, four refusals and auxiliary plan without implying a completed scan or starting more work?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
